{"asset_key":"ep6/gameplay_story_16601170","episode":"ep6","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"16601170","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1660117001:0":{"text":"来自绿裔的朋友，你们知道雅库伯尔吗？","source_cn":"来自绿裔的朋友，你们知道雅库伯尔吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5698F118FC12936","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1660117002:0":{"text":"嗯，我曾听达赫妮贤者提起过。万年以前，有一群原始兽人不远千里，从名为雅库伯尔的部落迁徙至薄暮丛林……","source_cn":"嗯，我曾听达赫妮贤者提起过。万年以前，有一群原始兽人不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38CD8357DA280D62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1660117003:1":{"text":"那些人应该就是如今一部分绿裔的先祖。","source_cn":"那些人应该就是如今一部分绿裔的先祖。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34EB44999C45166A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1660117004:0":{"text":"等等……先祖？","source_cn":"等等……先祖？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x601841B16FF6B6FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1660117005:1":{"text":"没错没错！我们蛮血和你们绿裔，可能有着共同的先祖哦！","source_cn":"没错没错！我们蛮血和你们绿裔，可能有着共同的先祖哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x968E4EFA588AF369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_